  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Initiation Plan (&#x201c;IP&#x201d;) will kickstart UNDP support to Serbia&#x2019;s EU Accession Negotiations as coordinated by the Ministry for European Integration of the Republic of Serbia (&#x201c;MEI&#x201d;).In its first phase, the project will focus on the application of the new enlargement methodology as a priority. In particular, the IP will enable the development of the Roadmap for functioning democratic institutions as one of the requirements under the new methodology. Additional activities and outputs will be deve</narrative>
